{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beast and Princess&quot; is a tower defense game where you battle it out by stringing together combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call upon plushie soldiers to sweep your enemies aside, and unleash ultimate moves to power through any pinch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a13bbdecb6224bcb50f4fdcb09750af7.poster.avif?t=1751282658\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a13bbdecb6224bcb50f4fdcb09750af7.webm?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a13bbdecb6224bcb50f4fdcb09750af7.mp4?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By stringing together ultimate moves, your attack power builds up, incentivizing well-timed combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/1573abcfce051d2ed7f78d61a4d5ae72.poster.avif?t=1751282658\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/1573abcfce051d2ed7f78d61a4d5ae72.webm?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/1573abcfce051d2ed7f78d61a4d5ae72.mp4?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every skill on its own is very powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff your favorite units and enter combat with your own unique super team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/52d28777bc64634b405533dd8b72c395.poster.avif?t=1751282658\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/52d28777bc64634b405533dd8b72c395.webm?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/52d28777bc64634b405533dd8b72c395.mp4?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, two princess twins found themselves suddenly trapped inside a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way out? Beat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In their path stand great foes, alongside a mysterious in-game voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a631406de1d641bdb4de2a6756d1a10c.poster.avif?t=1751282658\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a631406de1d641bdb4de2a6756d1a10c.webm?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216640/extras/a631406de1d641bdb4de2a6756d1a10c.mp4?t=1751282658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the twin princesses get trapped here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoever's behind the mysterious voice, what are they plotting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the ultimate question - do you have what it takes to reach the end of this thrilling story!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Twin Tension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"A Mysterious Voice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"Vexing Vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"Deathly Omen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"Parent-Teacher Conference","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"The Twin Princesses of Eclipsia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"No More Holding Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"The Whole Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"},{"name":"The Beast and the Princesses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216640/34e72f5cfe03d0be2f2a547355f6aff97d492941.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro